  {
   "text": "Then I saw a new heaven and a new earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The first heaven and the first earth had passed away",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the sea was no more",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I saw the holy city, the new Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coming down out of heaven from God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Prepared as a bride adorned for her husband",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, God's dwelling is with humanity",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will dwell with them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will wipe away every tear from their eyes",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Death will be no more",
